        "semantic_review": [
          "KnownCall adds only per-request real/replay mode to the existing private adaptive known-key interface. No finite independent key family or selected-key argument is introduced into reductionImpl, wrapped or decisionClient.",
          "Both interpreters pass known.real literally to the unchanged localImpl. Actual local AEAD, decoding, optional replies, nonce/history and replay-cache behavior remain in that program. selected_step retains the original selected callback and never synthesizes plaintext.",
          "known_step uses forward_complete and cache_schedule. The project restores selected public history while retaining all known entries, selected private state and the exact shared public cache. linked_schedule and schedule_interpretation preserve the entire represented source state under arbitrary adaptive continuations.",
          "sourceGame samples only the selected uniform key before executing a fixed client. Known keys may depend on earlier replies and have equal bytes. Production evolving-key distribution, history-slot consistency and logical attribution remain future compiler obligations.",
          "TargetClass ignores known work because forwarding only uses public hash and coin queries. Failed selected raw attempts remain counted. HashRoute counts selected public hashes, all real known non-uniform work, and replay known explicit hashes. Refused and malformed attempts remain safe upper-bound charges.",
          "PrivateRoute includes replay known seal and raw requests, including potential 64-byte cache fills. UniformRoute covers explicit random requests and is disjoint from PrivateRoute. The vector-budget transport yields qUniform + 64*qPrivate without uncharged private sampling. Public hash interpreter internal draws are separate from this explicit forwarded-query ledger.",
          "PlaintextCost counts exactly selected seal plaintext lengths; known local work issues no target seal. The weighted adaptive transport preserves this resource cap. None of these query bounds claims zero local running time.",
          "The comparisons instantiate existing validationReduction, indexedReduction and viewReduction with the same decisionClient. qSeal < 2^96, qHash/2^128, the factor two on the complete qRaw-indexed INT family, and qRaw/2^512 are retained exactly.",
          "The selected privacy endpoint is existing randomView for this decision client. Guide accurately leaves globally random records, production source equality, key distribution, aliases/nonces/refusal, dynamic selection, final resource transport and global origin/hiding open."
        ],
